  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onions and cook until they are softened and translucent.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, coriander, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the turnips, salt, and vegetable broth, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pot, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Check the turnips for tenderness and cook for an additional 10 minutes if needed.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve the stew over rice or with some crusty bread for a filling meal."
